---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const live=Boolean(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT);
---
<Layout title="Privacy notice" description="Read how the EZ Kyosk marketing website handles inquiry information and learn about the current preview configuration."><section class="page-heading"><div class="eyebrow">PRIVACY / CLEAR BY DESIGN</div><h1>Your information.<br/><em>Handled with clarity.</em></h1><p>Website configuration notice · Updated 3 November 2026.</p></section><div class="page-body prose"><div class="notice">{live?'Inquiry processing has been configured. The owner must confirm the provider, retention period, and privacy contact before public launch.':'This version is a website preview. Its inquiry form does not transmit or save the information you enter.'} The full inquiry privacy notice is pending owner confirmation.</div><h2>Information on this website</h2><p>The preview form shows the fields intended for business inquiries: name, email address, business type, message, and optional business name and phone number. In preview mode, processing stays in your browser and nothing is submitted by this form.</p><h2>Hosting and technical requests</h2><p>Your browser requests website files from the hosting provider. Once deployed, that provider may process technical request information such as IP addresses and browser details under its own policies. The final hosting provider will be named here before public launch.</p><h2>Fonts and external services</h2><p>Fonts are served locally with the website. No external font request is required. No analytics, advertising pixels, or embedded videos have been added.</p><h2>Before inquiries go live</h2><p>The site owner must confirm the business identity, privacy contact, inquiry provider, purpose of processing, retention period, access arrangements, and handling of privacy requests. The notice will then be updated to reflect that actual setup.</p><p>Do not enter sensitive or confidential information into the preview form.</p></div></Layout>
